@startuml
title MaquiControl - Identity & Access Management Bounded Context\nDesign-Level Event Storming

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam rectangleFontSize 12
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #BDB76B
skinparam ArrowColor #555555

' ===== Actor -> Command -> Aggregate -> Domain Event =====
rectangle "COMMAND\nSign Up" as CMD_SIGN_UP #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nUser Account" as AGG_USER_ACCOUNT_0 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nUser Signed Up" as EVT_USER_SIGNED_UP #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nVisitor" as ACT_VISITOR_0 #FFF9C4
rectangle "COMMAND\nSign In" as CMD_SIGN_IN #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nUser Account" as AGG_USER_ACCOUNT_1 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nUser Signed In" as EVT_USER_SIGNED_IN #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nUser" as ACT_USER_1 #FFF9C4
rectangle "COMMAND\nSign Out" as CMD_SIGN_OUT #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nUser Account" as AGG_USER_ACCOUNT_2 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nUser Signed Out" as EVT_USER_SIGNED_OUT #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nUser" as ACT_USER_2 #FFF9C4
rectangle "COMMAND\nAssign Role" as CMD_ASSIGN_ROLE #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nUser Account" as AGG_USER_ACCOUNT_3 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nRole Assigned" as EVT_ROLE_ASSIGNED #FFB74D

' ===== Policies =====
rectangle "POLICY\nWhen a user signs up,\nassign the selected role" as POL_0 #B39DDB

' ===== Read Models =====
rectangle "READ MODEL\nCurrent Session\n<size:10><i>Query: Get Signed-in Account</i></size>" as RM_0 #81C784
rectangle "ACTOR\nUser" as ACT_RM_0 #FFF9C4
rectangle "READ MODEL\nRole Catalog\n<size:10><i>Query: View Roles</i></size>" as RM_1 #81C784
rectangle "ACTOR\nVisitor" as ACT_RM_1 #FFF9C4
rectangle "HOTSPOT\nSign-in uses the Fake API until\nJWT authentication is implemented" as HOT_0 #EF9A9A

ACT_VISITOR_0 --> CMD_SIGN_UP
CMD_SIGN_UP --> AGG_USER_ACCOUNT_0
AGG_USER_ACCOUNT_0 --> EVT_USER_SIGNED_UP
note bottom of AGG_USER_ACCOUNT_0
<b>Business rules (User Account)</b>
- Email must be valid and unique
- Password is stored as a credential hash
- A role (FLEET_OWNER or CONTRACTOR)
  is required to sign up
- Only an active account can sign in
end note
ACT_USER_1 --> CMD_SIGN_IN
CMD_SIGN_IN --> AGG_USER_ACCOUNT_1
AGG_USER_ACCOUNT_1 --> EVT_USER_SIGNED_IN
ACT_USER_2 --> CMD_SIGN_OUT
CMD_SIGN_OUT --> AGG_USER_ACCOUNT_2
AGG_USER_ACCOUNT_2 --> EVT_USER_SIGNED_OUT
CMD_ASSIGN_ROLE --> AGG_USER_ACCOUNT_3
AGG_USER_ACCOUNT_3 --> EVT_ROLE_ASSIGNED
EVT_USER_SIGNED_UP --> POL_0
POL_0 --> CMD_ASSIGN_ROLE
EVT_USER_SIGNED_IN ..> RM_0 : updates
EVT_USER_SIGNED_OUT ..> RM_0 : updates
EVT_ROLE_ASSIGNED ..> RM_0 : updates
RM_0 ..> ACT_RM_0 : informs
RM_1 ..> ACT_RM_1 : informs
HOT_0 .. CMD_SIGN_IN

legend right
|= Color |= Element |
|<#FFF9C4>| Actor |
|<#87CEFA>| Command |
|<#FFF59D>| Aggregate |
|<#FFB74D>| Domain Event |
|<#B39DDB>| Policy |
|<#81C784>| Read Model |
|<#EF9A9A>| Hotspot |
|<#FFFDE7>| Business Rules (note) |
endlegend

@enduml
